WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Learning centre → Course builder and create or edit a draft.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Add sections and blocks from the outline or canvas insertion controls. Edit their properties in the left panel.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Write lessons, insert supported media or select a Knowledge Library article, and configure section formatting, transitions and reading time.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: Use Test course to walk through the learner flow without recording training.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Step 5: Check autosave, then publish a reviewed version separately.
